WEBVTT

00:13.480 --> 00:16.990
A refresher on soulmates.

00:17.710 --> 00:24.750
They are one's one-and-only ideal
romantic partner, chosen for them on birth.

00:25.000 --> 00:27.080
However, this boy,

00:27.080 --> 00:31.880
Aijo Rentaro has,
believe it or not, 100 soulmates!

00:31.880 --> 00:34.510
An embarrassment of bitches!

00:34.510 --> 00:37.390
Or so I'd like to say...

00:38.130 --> 00:43.520
But soulmates who don't get together
and live happily ever after with their partner

00:43.520 --> 00:46.000
are doomed to die.

00:47.100 --> 00:48.510
That said!

00:48.510 --> 00:51.280
Rentaro's love is limitless!

00:51.280 --> 00:57.690
He has sworn to truly love every soulmate
he meets and make them happy!

00:58.380 --> 01:04.380
This is the story of a boy with
a twisted fate and his 100 soulmates,

01:04.380 --> 01:09.140
an awe-inspiring,
heartrending tale of romance!

01:23.770 --> 01:28.980
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:29.810 --> 01:32.650
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:32.650 --> 01:34.940
Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep

01:34.940 --> 01:36.530
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

01:36.530 --> 01:37.780
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

01:37.780 --> 01:39.280
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

01:40.450 --> 01:42.990
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

01:42.990 --> 01:45.410
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

01:45.410 --> 01:47.710
(Kusuri
as newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

01:47.710 --> 01:48.370
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

01:48.370 --> 01:49.040
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

01:49.040 --> 01:50.580
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

01:50.710 --> 01:55.420
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

01:58.180 --> 01:59.840
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

02:05.470 --> 02:07.520
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

02:41.180 --> 02:42.260
Ladies and ladies.

02:42.580 --> 02:44.510
I thank you for coming here today.

02:44.510 --> 02:46.020
What d'you wanna discuss right away?

02:46.020 --> 02:46.338
Without Rentaro, even.

02:46.340 --> 02:47.850
- Season two time, aye!
Without Rentaro, even.

02:47.850 --> 02:48.648
- No Rentaro-chan...
Without Rentaro, even.

02:48.650 --> 02:49.580
- No Rentaro-chan...
- That's it!

02:50.660 --> 02:51.900
What is?

02:51.900 --> 02:57.400
It's said that most relationships enter
a phase of ennui after three months.

02:57.690 --> 03:03.320
Now, when was the last episode of season one,
where we started dating Rentaro-kun?

03:03.320 --> 03:05.090
December 2023.

03:05.090 --> 03:09.160
Correct. And season two has
started airing in January 2025.

03:09.470 --> 03:13.290
Which means... way more than
three months have passed!

03:15.220 --> 03:17.380
A maiden in love's pseudoscience!

03:17.380 --> 03:20.930
But 'tis true. Ennui sounds bad, bossman.

03:20.930 --> 03:23.550
But I only became his girlfriend
two episodes ago.

03:23.550 --> 03:25.430
It's over if Rentaro gets bored of me.

03:26.500 --> 03:27.430
Rest assured!

03:28.300 --> 03:30.680
I have a plan to shake things up.

03:31.320 --> 03:32.560
Kusuri-senpai.

03:32.560 --> 03:36.570
New drug that Hakari asked for
almost ready.

03:36.570 --> 03:38.090
Wii-Destroying Medicine...

03:38.090 --> 03:40.120
Ennui, Kusuri-senpai.

03:40.770 --> 03:42.450
- Wii...
- Ennui.

03:42.450 --> 03:45.450
Reborn-Self Medicine.

03:46.820 --> 03:47.750
Urk.

03:47.830 --> 03:50.330
Sorry I messed up, aye!

03:50.330 --> 03:51.830
What's wrong, everyone?!

03:52.380 --> 03:54.750
Season two just started!

03:54.750 --> 03:55.960
What's wrong?!

03:57.180 --> 03:59.320
What the heck? My body feels so heavy!

03:59.320 --> 04:01.160
Who's there? Is that... me?!

04:01.160 --> 04:02.640
Kusuri! Why are you Kusuri?!

04:02.640 --> 04:03.428
I-Is this... Could this be...

04:03.430 --> 04:05.970
- N-N-N-Not even in our dreams...
I-Is this... Could this be...

04:05.970 --> 04:09.350
We've... switched places?!

04:17.870 --> 04:20.120
Stop that at once! That is bad news!

04:20.120 --> 04:22.860
Aye! Earth is done for
if we get 100 comets!

04:22.860 --> 04:24.530
Not that part! The song! Copyright!

04:24.530 --> 04:27.340
Switched places? Like in <i>Your N*me.</i>?

04:27.340 --> 04:28.410
He went and said the thing!

04:28.410 --> 04:32.380
Was gonna jiggle our brain jelly
and change our personality,

04:32.380 --> 04:35.200
but our souls got jiggled instead!

04:35.200 --> 04:37.880
That woulda been messed up
even if it worked!

04:37.880 --> 04:41.200
The most efficient option would be
to accept our new bodies.

04:41.200 --> 04:43.680
You're way too quick to adapt.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.338
Who was it that just said my body was heavy?!

04:44.340 --> 04:47.250
- U-U-Um... M-My phone...
Who was it that just said my body was heavy?!

04:47.250 --> 04:50.040
H-Hold on a second.
This is getting out of hand.

04:50.040 --> 04:50.970
So, like...

04:51.340 --> 04:53.680
Who's who right now?!

04:55.180 --> 04:59.690
I can do whatever I want right now,
and nobody will know it was me!

05:00.170 --> 05:01.100
Oh no!

05:01.380 --> 05:04.100
I can't get used to this body!
I'm tripping over my own feet!

05:05.380 --> 05:07.720
Sniff, sniff... Ooh... sniff...

05:07.720 --> 05:08.320
Are you okay,

05:08.320 --> 05:09.270
Hakari?

05:10.060 --> 05:12.200
Huh? Oh, yes...

05:12.610 --> 05:13.680
How did he know?

05:13.680 --> 05:16.710
Kusuri next! Can you tell who Kusuri is?!

05:17.100 --> 05:19.340
Uh, you just gave it away.

05:19.340 --> 05:22.460
Hm? Feel the need to wee.

05:22.770 --> 05:24.890
Well, have diapers on,
so can just go here.

05:24.890 --> 05:26.590
Except I'm not wearing any diapers!

05:26.720 --> 05:28.540
To the restroom with you!

05:28.540 --> 05:32.010
Uh, so that's Kusuri-senpai
in Hakari's body.

05:32.010 --> 05:32.578
Who's in her body, then?

05:32.580 --> 05:33.850
- I... I...
Who's in her body, then?

05:33.850 --> 05:35.490
I'm so young!

05:35.490 --> 05:36.600
Okay, that's Hahari-san.

05:37.140 --> 05:40.850
I'm so small and energetic!
I can go wild and nobody will complain!

05:40.850 --> 05:43.770
I feel like you're plenty wild
in your own body.

05:49.510 --> 05:54.460
Listen, I was just bouncing them
to burn some fat, okay?!

05:54.460 --> 05:55.390
Karane, huh?

05:55.960 --> 05:57.940
Who's in Karane, then?

05:59.250 --> 06:00.750
Karane's got a peaceful smile!

06:01.790 --> 06:03.380
But she's all fidgety!

06:03.830 --> 06:05.210
What is she so mad about?

06:05.210 --> 06:07.130
What the hell do you take me for?!

06:07.530 --> 06:08.820
Did you need this?

06:09.630 --> 06:11.890
My apologies for not noticing sooner.

06:11.890 --> 06:12.640
Shizuka-ch—

06:12.640 --> 06:13.610
Cold!

06:13.610 --> 06:15.020
That was inefficient.

06:15.370 --> 06:17.440
Oh, so it's Shizuka-chan and...

06:17.440 --> 06:18.880
I could take down a dragon, bossman.

06:18.880 --> 06:20.110
I feel the scent of old books.

06:20.110 --> 06:20.900
Nano, huh?

06:20.980 --> 06:23.270
While we now know who's who,

06:23.270 --> 06:26.400
how do we get you back to your own bodies?

06:26.400 --> 06:28.530
Out of drug ingredients!

06:28.530 --> 06:32.780
In the tomes of yore,
butting heads was the silver bullet.

06:32.780 --> 06:33.780
Aye, that's it!

06:34.270 --> 06:35.630
Ready? Go!

06:36.290 --> 06:37.880
- Owie!
- Clang!

06:37.880 --> 06:39.670
Our heads!

06:39.670 --> 06:42.840
- Karane-san's stupid enough already!
- Hakari's got enough brain damage already!

06:43.130 --> 06:44.020
Huh?

06:44.020 --> 06:46.960
We need a miracle.
And I can think of only one way...

06:46.960 --> 06:49.650
A kiss with the prince!

06:49.650 --> 06:53.600
The chances of this just being an excuse
to kiss Aijo Rentaro is 100%.

06:53.930 --> 06:54.860
Now...

06:55.300 --> 06:57.220
Come to me, Rentaro-chan.

06:59.600 --> 07:02.600
There, there. That's a good boy.

07:02.930 --> 07:05.670
Aww, who's my adowable widdle boy?

07:07.290 --> 07:10.180
This maternal aura...
from such a tiny body!

07:12.110 --> 07:15.200
Wh-What is this emotion I'm feeling?

07:16.330 --> 07:19.080
And you know what good boys get?

07:19.080 --> 07:21.000
They get treats.

07:29.070 --> 07:30.880
We really got a miracle!

07:31.580 --> 07:36.420
Eureka! Usually feel lightheaded
after kiss because soul slipping out!

07:36.420 --> 07:39.020
Quit forming theories
based on little girl fantasies!

07:39.020 --> 07:40.360
This show's set in the real world!

07:40.360 --> 07:44.150
Souls not settled into the bodies yet.

07:44.150 --> 07:49.780
Then the most efficient option is for us all
to kiss and return to our bodies.

07:50.100 --> 07:54.340
M-Motherly Kusuri-senpai
was deadly as hell!

07:55.390 --> 07:58.590
Okay, Aijo Rentaro. Lower your head.

07:58.590 --> 08:00.790
Huh? O-Oh, right.

08:01.090 --> 08:04.600
Why are you so flustered?
Now is not the time.

08:04.600 --> 08:06.170
Cool Shizuka-chan!

08:07.170 --> 08:08.990
And now she pulls my chin in!

08:14.680 --> 08:16.180
Time for kissy!

08:16.510 --> 08:18.060
Babby Hakari!

08:19.310 --> 08:21.520
Something feel wrong, aye.

08:21.520 --> 08:22.270
Huh?

08:22.270 --> 08:24.900
When Kusuri press boobs on Rentaro,

08:24.900 --> 08:28.020
the tippies feel real nice, aye!

08:28.020 --> 08:29.400
She discovered lust!

08:29.400 --> 08:31.530
About to leak, but not wee.

08:31.530 --> 08:34.700
No, don't!
Stop that and come get your kiss!

08:34.700 --> 08:35.910
Oh, right, aye.

08:36.220 --> 08:38.410
Smooch.

08:39.720 --> 08:41.280
What a slutty high-schooler.

08:41.280 --> 08:43.540
H-Hey! They're just a little sensitive!

08:43.540 --> 08:46.720
My brain's frying from happiness.

08:46.720 --> 08:49.720
Keep it together until everyone's okay.

08:49.720 --> 08:50.550
I...

08:50.550 --> 08:52.100
Is it my turn now?

08:52.100 --> 08:53.670
Smol floof Karane!

08:57.110 --> 08:58.750
It's okay, don't worry.

08:58.750 --> 09:00.680
This is just some brain juice.

09:01.080 --> 09:02.930
H-Here I go.

09:06.330 --> 09:08.850
I'm about to spew brain juice again!

09:08.850 --> 09:10.190
Lots and lots of it!

09:14.850 --> 09:16.450
Wh-Who's next?

09:16.450 --> 09:17.390
Hmph!

09:17.700 --> 09:20.880
Hurry up and get this
nonsense over with already.

09:20.880 --> 09:22.200
Tsundere Hahari-san!

09:22.790 --> 09:25.360
The usually sweet Hahari-san
now has some spice.

09:25.360 --> 09:27.580
Wh-What are you staring at?!

09:27.970 --> 09:30.120
I-It's just, you're really cute.

09:30.960 --> 09:33.210
Sh-Shaddup, you idiot!

09:33.210 --> 09:35.340
It doesn't hurt at all. So adorable.

09:36.310 --> 09:38.280
Oh, forget it! I'm going back to class!

09:38.280 --> 09:42.510
What'll people think when they see
a board member sitting in on class?

09:42.510 --> 09:44.100
I'm sorry! Give me another chance!

09:44.350 --> 09:45.090
Hmph!

09:45.090 --> 09:46.870
Again, that's so adorable!

09:51.980 --> 09:53.050
Hmph!

09:55.640 --> 09:57.680
That leaves...

09:57.680 --> 10:01.890
It's finally just the two of us, Rentaro-kun.

10:01.890 --> 10:03.120
Lovey-dovey Nano!

10:03.120 --> 10:06.440
Look at those lights. They're so romantic.

10:06.440 --> 10:08.370
Those are souls up there.

10:11.280 --> 10:14.140
I love you so much, Rentaro-kun.

10:30.060 --> 10:31.710
Back to normal!

10:31.710 --> 10:33.390
The time for the exalted
awakening has come!

10:33.390 --> 10:35.405
- More like sexalted.
- I must admit,

10:35.407 --> 10:38.350
it's quite comfortable
being back in my own body.

10:38.350 --> 10:39.078
True. It maximizes efficiency of movement.

10:39.080 --> 10:41.048
- I-It's not like I'm glad to
True. It maximizes efficiency of movement.

10:41.050 --> 10:43.025
- be back or anything, okay?
- S-Six kisses in a row...

10:43.026 --> 10:45.580
This is an ecstasy overload!

10:45.990 --> 10:47.490
Rentaro-kun.

10:47.490 --> 10:50.690
What did you think of the shake-up today?

10:50.690 --> 10:51.620
Well...

10:51.900 --> 10:54.710
It was really exciting.

10:54.710 --> 10:57.960
Yes! It wasn't exactly what I had planned,

10:57.960 --> 11:02.030
but we still managed to give him
a taste of our special new—

11:02.030 --> 11:02.970
But...

11:02.970 --> 11:06.220
I honestly like you all
better the way you are.

11:09.980 --> 11:12.570
Then kiss me again as myself!

11:12.570 --> 11:13.730
M-Me too!

11:13.730 --> 11:14.970
Me too, bossman.

11:14.970 --> 11:15.600
Same.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.610
Kusuri too!

11:16.610 --> 11:18.180
And Mommy!

11:18.180 --> 11:24.510
His twisted fate wouldn't let him off
with just six kisses of bliss.

11:44.300 --> 11:45.760
Egg on toast?

11:46.120 --> 11:47.340
That looks good.

11:50.210 --> 11:51.420
Oh, sorry.

11:59.530 --> 12:02.530
(Krrrack!!)

12:04.250 --> 12:05.910
There's that zing again.

12:06.510 --> 12:07.530
A soulmate?

12:09.020 --> 12:10.250
Wait, what?

12:10.640 --> 12:12.750
Is that a middle school uniform?

12:13.040 --> 12:15.420
Huh? You got a problem?

12:15.420 --> 12:16.500
How friendly.

12:16.840 --> 12:21.790
There's no rule stopping me from
coming to the high school cafeteria.

12:21.790 --> 12:24.510
R-Right. Yeah, go ahead.

12:24.510 --> 12:26.130
That'll be 200 yen.

12:26.130 --> 12:27.330
G-Got it.

12:28.430 --> 12:29.630
Where's my wallet?

12:29.630 --> 12:31.500
N-Never mind. I'll pass.

12:32.450 --> 12:33.540
I'll take this one, ma'am.

12:33.540 --> 12:36.150
Gotcha. That'll be 150 yen.

12:40.190 --> 12:41.900
(krrrrrrr)

12:43.460 --> 12:44.180
Tch.

12:44.180 --> 12:45.110
Here.

12:45.660 --> 12:47.910
Wanna go halfsies with me?

12:49.160 --> 12:52.830
What's your deal?
You're being creepy as heck.

12:52.830 --> 12:54.920
Yep, I figured I was.

12:55.250 --> 12:59.840
Well, I'm going to eat something else
after this, so I'm good with half.

13:00.710 --> 13:02.780
Okay? But why would I take some rando's...

13:04.700 --> 13:07.180
Come on, help me out here.

13:08.140 --> 13:09.070
Tch!

13:12.780 --> 13:14.180
Thanks for the food.

13:14.560 --> 13:16.760
She actually knows her manners.

13:23.880 --> 13:25.810
Yummy!

13:25.810 --> 13:26.740
Whomst?!

13:26.900 --> 13:30.420
Oh, this hits the spot!
Egg on toast so good!

13:31.050 --> 13:32.950
Is it a favorite?

13:35.210 --> 13:38.740
Some classmates were talking
about a movie that had it,

13:38.740 --> 13:40.630
so I got the craving for it.

13:41.180 --> 13:42.960
Y'know, the egg on toast from <i>L*puta</i>.

13:42.960 --> 13:46.250
I get it. They make it look so good.

13:46.250 --> 13:48.390
Sorry, it's too delicious for me.

13:48.820 --> 13:51.640
I burn through food really fast,

13:51.960 --> 13:54.510
so I always get hungry and cranky.

13:54.510 --> 13:56.640
And when I want to eat something specific,

13:56.990 --> 13:58.830
it gets even worse.

13:59.490 --> 14:02.150
S-So, uh, you know...

14:02.570 --> 14:05.280
I'm sorry if I was rude to you.

14:05.940 --> 14:07.640
Don't worry about it.

14:08.530 --> 14:12.140
All I ever think about is food.

14:12.140 --> 14:16.540
Whenever I see anything,
I get some new craving by association.

14:16.540 --> 14:20.360
A blackboard makes me crave tonkotsu
soy sauce ramen with extra seaweed.

14:20.360 --> 14:23.080
And seeing Yamazaki-san around
makes me want Yamazaki bread.

14:23.080 --> 14:25.050
Life must be hard for you!

14:25.050 --> 14:29.600
That's why I try to shut out my vision
and hearing with a hoodie and headphones.

14:29.600 --> 14:32.140
Oh, so that's what they're for.

14:32.820 --> 14:34.910
But you've got them off now.

14:34.910 --> 14:40.400
I want to savor the scent of food in the air
and the sound each bite makes.

14:40.680 --> 14:43.400
It's the least I could do for the food.

14:48.280 --> 14:49.860
That was great.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.360
Bye.

14:51.780 --> 14:53.240
H-Hey...

14:53.240 --> 14:55.670
Could you tell me your name?

14:56.240 --> 14:59.480
Wha? Are you hitting on me, you creep?

14:59.480 --> 15:01.250
That's some crazy metabolism!

15:04.500 --> 15:05.430
Tch.

15:06.350 --> 15:08.860
Why is my heart racing?

15:08.860 --> 15:10.680
I don't get it!

15:12.340 --> 15:15.010
Lunch break, the next day.

15:17.520 --> 15:18.720
So, you know...

15:22.230 --> 15:24.280
I want a menchi-katsu sandwich.

15:24.280 --> 15:25.980
I want a menchi-katsu sandwich!

15:26.520 --> 15:30.990
The whole class kept yapping about it
because it showed up in some TV show!

15:31.490 --> 15:35.370
Thankfully, they sell it
in the middle school cafeteria.

15:35.370 --> 15:36.370
(Menchi-Katsu Sandwich)
(Sold Out)

15:36.370 --> 15:37.710
Sold out?!

15:37.710 --> 15:41.120
Sorry, they sold like hotcakes
today for some reason.

15:41.120 --> 15:43.920
That damn TV show again?!

15:43.920 --> 15:45.880
What are you craving today?

15:47.200 --> 15:49.710
Wha... What are you doing here?

15:49.710 --> 15:55.160
There's no rule stopping me from
coming to the middle school cafeteria.

15:56.440 --> 15:58.980
Oh, was it a menchi-katsu sandwich?

15:58.980 --> 16:01.620
They sure are popular.
Even our cafeteria ran out of them.

16:01.620 --> 16:02.770
The high school wing too?

16:03.320 --> 16:07.020
They still have katsu sandwiches.
Is close enough not good enough?

16:07.020 --> 16:08.540
How is it close enough?

16:08.540 --> 16:10.910
They're as different as smooth
and crunchy peanut butter.

16:10.910 --> 16:12.150
Is that really a big difference?

16:12.150 --> 16:15.470
Whatever! I'm sure I can get a menchi-katsu
sandwich at a convenience store!

16:15.470 --> 16:16.660
Wait, hold up.

16:16.660 --> 16:20.450
You know that middle school students aren't
allowed to leave the campus during recess.

16:20.450 --> 16:21.850
I'll go instead.

16:21.850 --> 16:22.880
Again!

16:22.880 --> 16:25.540
I don't need your
freaking help, all right?!

16:25.860 --> 16:27.920
Leave me alone!

16:39.560 --> 16:42.100
How are they sold out everywhere?

16:42.100 --> 16:43.980
(krrrrrrr)

16:50.090 --> 16:54.570
I'm so mad!

16:54.570 --> 16:58.370
And I'm most mad at myself!

16:59.100 --> 17:01.120
Why am I always like this?

17:01.120 --> 17:06.320
I get cranky and take it out on others,
leaving me all alone.

17:07.240 --> 17:09.750
He was so nice to someone like me,

17:10.370 --> 17:11.610
but I pushed him away too.

17:12.300 --> 17:17.010
I'm always hungry and cranky.
There's not a single good thing about me.

17:17.470 --> 17:19.920
What the hell is wrong with me?!

17:24.860 --> 17:26.600
Oh, there you are.

17:27.660 --> 17:30.440
I'm glad you got back
before lunch break ended.

17:30.440 --> 17:31.730
Y-You...

17:32.040 --> 17:33.490
Okay, come with me.

17:33.820 --> 17:34.750
Huh?

17:35.470 --> 17:36.400
What?!

17:36.700 --> 17:38.490
A menchi-katsu sandwich?!

17:38.820 --> 17:40.510
Go ahead and try it.

17:41.490 --> 17:44.313
I-I said I didn't need your help!

17:44.314 --> 17:45.669
- I know, I know.
I-I said I didn't need your help!

17:45.670 --> 17:47.530
Help with half, then.

17:47.530 --> 17:49.000
Just like yesterday.

17:54.880 --> 17:56.760
(krrrrrrr)

18:01.810 --> 18:04.020
Y-Yummy!

18:04.710 --> 18:07.140
Yum, so yum!

18:07.630 --> 18:09.290
Yeah, it's good.

18:09.290 --> 18:11.600
H-How'd you get this?

18:11.600 --> 18:14.570
I got permission to make it here.

18:14.570 --> 18:16.460
I didn't have the ingredients or the time,

18:16.460 --> 18:19.750
so I fried up the patty
from a cafeteria hamburger...

18:20.280 --> 18:22.030
sizzle

18:22.430 --> 18:25.120
And stuck it between the bread
and cabbage in a katsu sandwich.

18:28.860 --> 18:31.160
Wait, those bandages...

18:31.160 --> 18:35.050
I washed the ketchup off the patty
with water and then immediately fried it.

18:35.370 --> 18:39.800
I had no idea how big a mistake that was.
It felt like the end of the world.

18:42.580 --> 18:45.550
Why are you so nice to me?

18:45.550 --> 18:47.150
You don't even know my name.

18:47.150 --> 18:50.310
I was so rude to you.
There's nothing good about me.

18:50.590 --> 18:52.810
But there is.

18:52.810 --> 18:54.800
Don't try to console me with your empty—

18:54.800 --> 18:55.670
Well...

18:55.750 --> 19:00.320
You cherish your food and enjoy
every meal with all your heart,

19:00.950 --> 19:03.030
and I found that very charming.

19:03.580 --> 19:07.250
Wha? I'm just eating normally.

19:07.250 --> 19:10.590
And you still make it look
so good. That's a skill.

19:10.590 --> 19:13.090
You say you get hungry too easily,

19:13.090 --> 19:17.710
but I think that's why
you can love food so much.

19:18.040 --> 19:23.530
And sharing a meal with someone enjoying
their food makes it taste that much better.

19:25.240 --> 19:31.340
You have these wonderful qualities
that can bring the people around you joy.

19:36.330 --> 19:39.320
Th-Then you're the same.

19:39.320 --> 19:39.970
Huh?

19:39.970 --> 19:44.740
When I eat with you, everything tastes
even better than it usually does.

19:45.140 --> 19:50.140
S-So... could you keep eating with me?

19:50.140 --> 19:53.750
Y-You know, as my boy... boyfriend?

19:53.750 --> 19:56.250
Maybe?

19:57.610 --> 19:58.760
Thank you!

19:59.070 --> 20:03.580
I'd love nothing more
than to eat lunch with you.

20:05.030 --> 20:06.620
I have a name.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.770
Kurumi.

20:09.240 --> 20:12.890
That's my name. I'm Haraga Kurumi,
third-year in our middle school.

20:13.610 --> 20:14.650
Ah.

20:14.940 --> 20:16.740
Nice to meet you, Kurumi-chan.

20:16.740 --> 20:19.100
I'm Aijo Rentaro,
a first-year in our high school.

20:19.100 --> 20:20.650
Don't call me "Kurumi-chan."

20:21.000 --> 20:22.650
It makes me crave chanko stew!

20:22.650 --> 20:25.160
Never heard anyone reject being
called "chan" for that reason before!

20:27.160 --> 20:29.410
And there you have it.

20:29.410 --> 20:35.280
May I have your permission to welcome
Haraga Kurumi-san as my newest girlfriend?

20:35.280 --> 20:39.300
Yeah, whatever. What've we got
this time? Punk? Magical girl?

20:40.020 --> 20:41.120
Hungry, hungry GF.

20:41.120 --> 20:43.050
That's not an aesthetic.

20:43.320 --> 20:47.100
Kurumi often gets hungry
and somewhat irritable...

20:47.100 --> 20:51.640
FYI, I'm not about to get chummy
with anyone other than Rentaro-senpai.

20:51.640 --> 20:54.180
Oh? Starting off strong, are we?

20:54.180 --> 20:55.290
Scary girl?

20:55.290 --> 20:57.270
Oh dear. I hope this works out.

20:57.810 --> 20:58.740
Fair.

20:58.980 --> 21:02.050
Pointless fraternizing
between us girlfriends is inefficient.

21:02.050 --> 21:02.650
Nano?!

21:02.650 --> 21:04.130
Wh-What do you mean, pointless?!

21:04.130 --> 21:06.330
What about all the good times
we've shared?!

21:06.330 --> 21:08.660
Thought we were friends, you meanie!

21:09.130 --> 21:14.540
I don't spend time with you all because
I need to. I do it because I love you all.

21:14.810 --> 21:15.920
Ba-dump!

21:16.790 --> 21:18.960
I love you too, Nano-san.

21:18.960 --> 21:19.810
Kusuri too.

21:19.810 --> 21:20.920
Mommy loves you too!

21:20.920 --> 21:22.460
What's going on here?

21:23.050 --> 21:25.120
What's with these people?

21:26.970 --> 21:28.800
By the way, did you girls hear?

21:28.800 --> 21:30.810
It's happening this Sunday.

21:31.070 --> 21:32.930
A food fight festival!

21:32.930 --> 21:36.690
The winner gets prize money and
special gelato from a three-star patissier!

21:37.560 --> 21:39.610
Special gelato!

21:39.610 --> 21:41.320
Teams of up to ten can compete,

21:41.660 --> 21:43.360
so we can all enter together.

21:45.150 --> 21:47.700
I can win that by myself.

21:48.050 --> 21:49.650
I'll enter solo.

21:49.650 --> 21:50.700
Huh? But...

21:50.700 --> 21:53.940
I'll only clash with the others.

21:53.940 --> 21:57.210
Teaming with small eaters
will only hold me back, too.

21:57.210 --> 22:00.610
It says here that middle schoolers and
younger must be accompanied by a guardian.

22:00.610 --> 22:02.830
Both my parents work Sundays.

22:02.830 --> 22:05.840
But I must have that special gelato
no matter what.

22:06.170 --> 22:10.720
I guess you could pretend
to be my mom and sign me up.

22:10.720 --> 22:11.790
That's enough.

22:12.720 --> 22:14.840
I'll do it if you call me "Mommy."

22:14.840 --> 22:16.230
Over my dead body!

22:16.520 --> 22:19.530
And so they all entered together.
